---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: archiv-google-ads
permalink: /archiv-google-ads.html
---
{% include "partials/header-journal.njk" %}
<main id="hauptinhalt">
  <section class="j-listing cm-archive" id="artikel">
    <div class="j-shell">
      <div class="j-section-kicker">+ JOURNAL / THEMENARCHIV</div>
      <nav aria-label="Brotkrumen"><a href="/creaid-blog">Journal ↗</a></nav>
      <h1 class="cm-archive-title">Google Ads.</h1>
      <p>Wenn Suchanzeigen Klicks, aber keine passenden Anfragen bringen, prüfen Sie Suchbegriffe, Zielseite und Messung gemeinsam. Hier finden Sie den Ursachenratgeber und eine praktische Ergänzung zur Landingpage-Planung.</p>
      <div class="j-articles">{% for archiveSlug in ["beste-landingpage-elemente-fuer-kampagnen"] %}{% for post in postsIndex | releaseJournal %}{% if post.slug == archiveSlug %}<article class="j-card"><a href="{{ post.url | escape }}"><div class="j-card-image"><img src="{{ post.image | escape }}" alt="" width="{{ post.width }}" height="{{ post.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="j-card-top">{{ post.categoryText | escape }}</div><h3>{{ post.title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ post.excerpt | escape }}</p><div class="j-card-bottom"><span>{% if post.date %}<time datetime="{{ post.date }}">{{ post.dateLabel }}</time> · {% endif %}ca. {{ post.minutes }} Min.</span><span class="j-card-read">LESEN ↗</span></div></a></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
        {% for post in postsIndex | releaseJournal %}
          {% if post.slug == "google-ads-aber-keine-anfragen" %}
            {% include "partials/journal-card.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p><a class="j-button" href="/creaid-blog">Alle Beiträge entdecken ↗</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer-journal.njk" %}
